From 2cb7cd68da8c8b98c03b2f7598d6e0538605b6e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pair-spec lane <pair-spec@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:08:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] fix(uniswap-v2): pair premise without hash injectivity

Name the pair statement's premise PairAllowanceApart: the words
allowance[address(0)][s] that the ERC20 invariant reads avoid the
pair's 13 fixed slots. Drop the balanceOf[address(0)] half, which the
kernel computes (TrustedBase.image3), and show the premise holds for a
hash model, so it is not False in disguise. The new name keeps the
pair's premise apart from Verify/Spec/HashScope.lean's HashScope.

Add an axiom audit of every pair headline, checked by #guard_msgs.
