From 1a855e0c8456d39b7495f17f5cde88311900a3bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pair-spec lane <pair-spec@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:14:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] feat(uniswap-v2): skim negative control by execution

Run skim(0x3000) with token balances 11000/10500 over reserves
10000/10000 on the exact bytes and the checked source (reserves kept),
and on a mutant that forces the reserves to the balances first, as
solar's compile and SolidCore's translation of the mutant source
(reserves 11000/10500). The published spec refuses every successful
skim observable with reserve0 moved (skimUpdate_refused, kernel).
