Subject: [PATCH 4/4] test(uniswap-v2): prove the sync spec accepts a no-op

Run sync on the exact bytes and the checked source (reserves move to
the balances 11000/9094) and prove the published spec accepts a sync
that leaves them at 10000/10000 (syncNoop_accepted): sync's exported
ensures keep only the supply and the lock, and _update's reserve
postcondition is not among the exported function specs. A sync
without _update cannot be refused by this spec.
